WEBVTT

01:36.670 --> 01:38.490
You're falling behind, Lucius!

01:38.490 --> 01:39.380
Sir!

01:41.920 --> 01:44.250
Please, Prince Theodore.

01:44.550 --> 01:48.250
Don't you think you're 
making use of me in the wrong way?

01:48.600 --> 01:52.880
You said you want to join the knight 
candidates' training as a man, right?

01:52.880 --> 01:55.150
I'm not sure that's a good idea.

01:55.150 --> 01:57.800
Why should I help you?

01:57.800 --> 02:00.960
You sent me a letter the 
other day, didn't you?

02:00.960 --> 02:02.760
It said I could rely on your help.

02:02.760 --> 02:05.770
Yes, I wrote that! I wrote that, but...

02:06.600 --> 02:09.200
But why do you need to
 sneak in to begin with?

02:09.200 --> 02:11.830
You could just have a knight 
assigned to instruct you.

02:11.830 --> 02:14.310
If I did that, they'd surely 
try to be considerate of me,

02:14.310 --> 02:16.780
and I want to be trained without any mercy.

02:16.780 --> 02:20.860
Unbelievable. To think you'd willingly 
choose to go and be treated harshly.

02:20.860 --> 02:22.200
I could never do it.

02:23.640 --> 02:24.630
Hold on.

02:28.480 --> 02:29.600
Your Highness?

02:29.600 --> 02:33.300
Very well! I shall assist 
my lovely older sister.

02:33.300 --> 02:37.070
I will exert every effort 
to make your wish come true.

02:37.070 --> 02:39.930
Um, why the sudden change?

02:39.930 --> 02:42.800
Well, it seems entertaining, doesn't it?

02:43.270 --> 02:46.400
I think that even my older brother 
would never be able to anticipate it.

02:46.400 --> 02:49.920
Who'd ever think, "My wife is going to 
dress as a man to infiltrate the knights"?

02:49.920 --> 02:53.880
How could I not take the opportunity 
to surprise my brother like this?

02:53.880 --> 02:58.360
It isn't as though I'm doing this
to shock Prince Arnold, you know.

03:00.730 --> 03:06.940
I would love to see the look 
on my brother's face, whatever it is.

03:11.140 --> 03:13.070
That's enough for today! Dismissed!

03:13.070 --> 03:14.730
Thank you, sir!

03:17.960 --> 03:21.070
<i>This is Galkhein's basic training?</i>

03:21.070 --> 03:23.210
Are you all right, Lucius?

03:24.490 --> 03:28.750
Fritz. Thanks, but I'll be all 
right after I rest a little.

03:28.750 --> 03:30.450
I'll join you.

03:30.450 --> 03:33.090
Even if I head back to the 
inn, I'll just be alone.

03:33.090 --> 03:33.900
Inn?

03:34.240 --> 03:36.640
I came here from Ceutena.

03:36.640 --> 03:39.980
Have you heard of it? It's 
a port town in the north.

03:39.980 --> 03:43.010
That's where ships from 
Coyolles dock, isn't it?

03:43.010 --> 03:45.380
Yes, it's a great town.

03:45.380 --> 03:47.280
If I didn't look up to that person so much,

03:47.280 --> 03:51.340
I'd never have aimed to be a knight, and I'd 
probably have lived my whole life in that town.

03:51.340 --> 03:52.590
That person?

03:52.590 --> 03:54.040
Prince Arnold!

03:54.920 --> 03:56.420
The war hero!

03:56.420 --> 03:57.900
Master of the sword!

03:57.900 --> 03:59.510
He's just so amazing, don't you think?

03:59.510 --> 04:00.550
Yes...

04:00.550 --> 04:04.640
I want to become a great knight, 
just like Prince Arnold.

04:04.640 --> 04:05.680
You there.

04:06.160 --> 04:09.200
You mustn't refer to members of the 
imperial family in that manner.

04:09.200 --> 04:12.390
You must be careful to call him 
His Highness, the crown prince.

04:12.390 --> 04:13.820
Y-Yes, sir!

04:14.210 --> 04:15.420
As long as you understand.

04:15.420 --> 04:16.620
Raise your heads.

04:18.110 --> 04:20.660
You're... Count Lawvine!

04:21.440 --> 04:23.350
<i>His Lordship, Count Lawvine?</i>

04:23.350 --> 04:27.240
<i>He's the guardian of the north and a loyal 
retainer to the Galkhein imperial family.</i>

04:27.240 --> 04:28.330
<i>But three years from now,</i>

04:28.680 --> 04:30.900
<i>Prince Arnold, who will have become emperor,</i>

04:30.900 --> 04:33.340
<i>will declare him a monstrous 
criminal, and he'll be slaughtered.</i>

04:35.110 --> 04:37.580
<i>H-Has he noticed 
I'm only dressed as a ma—</i>

04:37.580 --> 04:39.920
Do you like to eat chicken?

04:39.920 --> 04:40.590
Huh?

04:40.880 --> 04:42.900
Y-Yes, I do!

04:42.900 --> 04:45.760
I see. In that case, you 
should eat more of it.

04:46.200 --> 04:50.790
From what I can see, you have less 
muscle mass than the average man.

04:50.790 --> 04:52.100
Y-Yes, sir!

04:52.730 --> 04:55.780
Starting tomorrow, I will 
be joining your instructors.

04:55.780 --> 04:56.920
I look forward to working with you.

04:56.920 --> 04:57.730
What?

04:58.580 --> 05:02.200
Your Lordship, it's nearly time for your 
audience with His Majesty, the emperor.

05:02.200 --> 05:03.740
Yes, I'll go immediately.

05:04.090 --> 05:05.470
If you'll excuse me.

05:05.470 --> 05:06.760
Thank you, sir!

05:06.850 --> 05:08.360
Thank you, sir!

05:36.160 --> 05:37.750
Elsie, I'm back.

05:37.750 --> 05:38.900
Welcome home.

05:48.070 --> 05:49.460
Prince Arnold.

05:49.460 --> 05:50.660
Good morning.

05:51.040 --> 05:53.360
Were you able to sleep last night?

05:53.360 --> 05:54.160
Yes.

05:57.020 --> 05:58.030
Your Highness?

06:00.670 --> 06:03.550
Tomorrow afternoon at two, 
come to the western back gate.

06:04.280 --> 06:06.050
Don't let anyone see you.

06:09.050 --> 06:10.800
Should I dye my hair?

06:10.800 --> 06:12.550
No, that isn't necessary.

06:12.550 --> 06:16.520
I see. Then, I will arrive in clothes 
that will look natural in town.

06:21.980 --> 06:24.070
Um, Lady Rishe?

06:24.070 --> 06:25.070
Yes?

06:25.070 --> 06:28.070
Why were you speaking 
secretly with Prince Arnold?

06:28.530 --> 06:31.320
The truth is that the prince and 
I are going into town tomorrow.

06:31.630 --> 06:34.830
What sort of business is taking you there?

06:35.840 --> 06:38.960
I'm certain it must be some 
sort of official business.

06:39.810 --> 06:42.390
It would be best to wear 
something that won't stand out.

06:42.390 --> 06:45.340
A brown linen dress and a 
simple gray robe would—

06:45.340 --> 06:46.840
Lady Rishe!

06:46.840 --> 06:48.170
Please leave it to me.

06:48.170 --> 06:48.880
What?

06:48.880 --> 06:50.340
L-Leave what to you?

06:50.340 --> 06:53.980
I promise I will make you lovelier 
than anyone else ever could.

06:53.980 --> 06:54.980
What?

07:03.190 --> 07:05.360
Now that we've made it this 
far, we should be all right.

07:05.780 --> 07:07.520
You can lower your hood.

07:09.510 --> 07:13.420
Don't worry. None of the 
citizens here know your face.

07:13.420 --> 07:15.740
Th-That's true.

07:29.710 --> 07:31.760
I know exactly what you want to say!

07:31.760 --> 07:35.290
I had guessed that this must 
be official business...

07:35.290 --> 07:37.580
but being dressed too plainly 
would stand out, too!

07:37.580 --> 07:41.890
Since it's you, I thought you'd come 
in a linen dress and plain robe.

07:41.890 --> 07:44.210
Am I really that predictable?

07:44.210 --> 07:45.740
Is this your maid's doing?

07:47.110 --> 07:49.340
Those clothes pose no problems.

07:49.340 --> 07:50.510
Truly?

07:50.510 --> 07:53.430
I must give your maid my highest praise.

07:53.430 --> 07:54.490
Let's go.

07:54.490 --> 07:54.910
What?

07:55.240 --> 07:56.960
Please wait for me!

08:07.170 --> 08:08.590
The marketplace!

08:10.400 --> 08:12.600
It's just a marketplace, 
the kind you'd find anywhere.

08:12.600 --> 08:14.680
That's not true!

08:15.200 --> 08:17.700
Those are Coquito's famous grapes!

08:17.700 --> 08:19.430
Those are rare saloof bird eggs!

08:19.430 --> 08:20.960
And could those be—

08:27.060 --> 08:30.260
A-A marketplace does, of course, show 
the current economic conditions,

08:30.260 --> 08:33.420
but it also reflects the public 
peace of the surrounding areas.

08:38.450 --> 08:40.120
<i>A pocket watch?</i>

08:41.590 --> 08:43.740
Your Highness? Is there something over there?

08:43.740 --> 08:45.330
You want to see the marketplace, don't you?

08:48.000 --> 08:49.570
Thank you!

08:54.720 --> 08:57.220
What do you think? These are fresh berries!

08:57.220 --> 08:58.940
These are a specialty from Coyolles!

08:58.940 --> 09:01.220
They've just come in from Ceutena!

09:01.220 --> 09:03.380
Young lady, I'll give you a discount!

09:05.360 --> 09:06.730
Sorry to keep you waiting!

09:07.710 --> 09:08.610
Wait.

09:09.000 --> 09:10.900
What is that disquieting object?

09:10.900 --> 09:12.710
A fruit from Coyolles.

09:12.710 --> 09:16.240
It looks a little unusual, but it's very 
nutritious, so it's good for the body.

09:16.240 --> 09:19.770
I said, wait. No matter how I think 
about it, that appearance is—

09:19.010 --> 09:20.620
It's good for the body.

09:28.540 --> 09:32.300
How do you like it? It's sweeter 
than it looks, I think.

09:34.510 --> 09:36.840
It tastes like it's nutritious.

09:36.840 --> 09:39.240
My, what a bitter expression!

09:44.030 --> 09:45.630
We should get moving.

09:45.630 --> 09:49.480
If we stay in one place for too long, 
Oliver's deputies will find us.

09:55.520 --> 09:57.730
<i>He isn't executing official duties today?</i>

10:02.620 --> 10:04.880
The proprietor here doesn't 
come to the palace.

10:05.410 --> 10:08.130
Thanks to that, it becomes 
necessary for me to come here.

10:15.360 --> 10:17.170
We've been awaiting your arrival.

10:19.050 --> 10:22.560
To be employed by Your Highness, the 
crown prince, brings us great joy and—

10:22.560 --> 10:24.910
No need for speeches. Raise your heads.

10:26.320 --> 10:28.400
It's an honor to meet you.

10:28.400 --> 10:33.400
I'm the proprietor of this 
store, Mihaela Laure Wehrmann.

10:33.400 --> 10:37.550
Pleased to meet you. My name 
is Rishe Irmgard Weitzner.

10:42.280 --> 10:43.530
How beautiful!

10:43.530 --> 10:46.720
We are humble jewelers.

10:46.720 --> 10:49.470
Lady Rishe, among these stones,

10:49.470 --> 10:52.430
which do you think is a fake?

10:52.430 --> 10:53.420
What?

10:53.980 --> 10:55.110
Rishe.

10:55.110 --> 10:56.150
Try answering her.

11:12.610 --> 11:13.940
I don't know.

11:14.230 --> 11:16.880
What a clear answer.

11:16.880 --> 11:19.950
Being able to answer so 
honestly is a wonderful—

11:19.950 --> 11:21.570
So, Madam Proprietor,

11:21.570 --> 11:24.200
may I borrow some appraisal tools?

11:24.200 --> 11:25.020
Pardon me?

11:34.890 --> 11:38.590
<i>Each one has a high degree of transparency, 
and the cuts are very fine.</i>

11:39.720 --> 11:40.740
<i>However...</i>

11:43.370 --> 11:44.220
These stones...

11:44.490 --> 11:46.470
all three of them are 
imitations, aren't they?

11:47.890 --> 11:49.520
I failed to recognize your skills.

11:49.520 --> 11:54.100
You are the first to request appraisal tools.

11:54.400 --> 11:57.820
That said, they truly are beautiful.

11:57.820 --> 11:59.990
Even knowing that they are imitations,

12:00.430 --> 12:06.130
I'm sure there must be many people 
who love and care for these stones.

12:08.480 --> 12:09.800
You are...

12:11.730 --> 12:14.220
I find myself admiring you more and more.

12:14.220 --> 12:16.800
What? Oh, but I haven't done 
anything to warrant it!

12:16.800 --> 12:21.130
Our merchandise in this store 
is only sold to a select few.

12:21.130 --> 12:25.010
I would very much like to show you our wares.

12:26.720 --> 12:30.850
If you've approved of her, then 
give her exactly what she wishes.

12:30.850 --> 12:33.520
Yes, we will ready our wares with pleasure.

12:33.520 --> 12:36.680
What? What is going on here?

12:36.680 --> 12:41.110
I thought I was accompanying Your Highness 
to fulfill your wishes, wasn't I?

12:41.990 --> 12:43.990
The one thing I wish from you...

12:44.710 --> 12:47.120
is for you to allow me to 
gift you a ring. That's all.

12:47.120 --> 12:49.120
What? A ring?

12:49.120 --> 12:50.550
His Highness, the crown prince,

12:50.550 --> 12:54.430
seeks a ring to give to his bride 
during the wedding ceremony.

12:54.430 --> 12:56.880
Now, I will prepare a few things and return.

12:58.130 --> 13:00.880
<i>Ring? Bride?</i>

13:00.880 --> 13:02.810
<i>Why? For what purpose?</i>

13:02.810 --> 13:06.490
<i>In Galkhein, a ring shouldn't be necessary.</i>

13:06.490 --> 13:07.890
<i>But more importantly...</i>

13:08.190 --> 13:10.950
How did our sparring 
match lead you to this conclusion?

13:10.950 --> 13:13.780
If I said, "I'll buy you a 
ring, so pick what you'd like,"

13:13.780 --> 13:17.020
I can't imagine that you'd 
quietly make your choice.

13:17.510 --> 13:20.880
You wouldn't accept others buying 
things to give to you, would you?

13:21.650 --> 13:24.410
The stones they have here are first-class.

13:24.410 --> 13:26.820
I have no intention of letting 
money be an obstacle.

13:26.820 --> 13:30.160
But, Your Highness, I don't think that 
I can readily accept such a valuable—

13:30.160 --> 13:32.480
If you have a ring made here,

13:32.480 --> 13:35.900
then my idle wealth, which I have no 
means of using, will fall to the town.

13:35.900 --> 13:37.290
It will help the economy.

13:39.800 --> 13:42.800
I see. In that case...

13:42.800 --> 13:44.600
I shall make my choice!

13:44.600 --> 13:47.050
With utmost sincerity and 
with everything I have in me!

13:52.570 --> 13:54.560
<i>The ring will be put on me 
during the wedding,</i>

13:54.890 --> 13:57.060
<i>so maybe a diamond would be best?</i>

13:57.360 --> 14:01.130
<i>Or, perhaps, to match my eyes... an emerald?</i>

14:11.140 --> 14:15.140
I ask out of solicitude, but 
may I offer a suggestion?

14:15.140 --> 14:16.710
Yes, please do.

14:17.270 --> 14:20.960
Putting on a favorite piece of 
jewelry and wearing it proudly...

14:20.960 --> 14:24.710
Just that simple action can 
fill a girl with courage.

14:26.020 --> 14:28.330
This will become your very 
own protective amulet.

14:28.330 --> 14:31.300
Pick something you genuinely like.

14:31.970 --> 14:35.770
For example, Lady Rishe, 
what color do you like?

14:35.770 --> 14:37.390
What color do I like?

14:47.920 --> 14:52.410
<i>Like crystal clear ice from a 
frozen sea in a cold country...</i>

14:52.410 --> 14:53.800
<i>That sort of color...</i>

14:56.700 --> 15:01.000
Do you have a stone here that 
is the same color as his eyes?

15:08.910 --> 15:09.700
Wait...

15:11.930 --> 15:13.760
Oh, my! My, my!

15:13.760 --> 15:15.280
No, it isn't like that!

15:15.280 --> 15:17.480
What I just said didn't 
carry any unusual meaning!

15:17.480 --> 15:18.930
I really have no hidden purpose,

15:18.930 --> 15:21.960
it's only that I've always liked 
the color of Prince Arnold's eyes,

15:21.960 --> 15:23.440
and thought that it's pretty, that's all!

15:24.490 --> 15:27.070
You've always thought that, have you?

15:27.070 --> 15:29.040
If you'll wait just a moment please.

15:29.040 --> 15:31.510
I have something I'd like 
to recommend to you.

15:31.510 --> 15:33.480
Madam Proprietor!

15:38.130 --> 15:41.580
Please, forget what just happened here.

15:46.740 --> 15:50.960
Oh, this beautiful sunset 
is illuminating the palace!

15:55.760 --> 15:58.410
Why the third finger of your left hand?

15:58.410 --> 15:59.200
What?

15:59.200 --> 16:02.560
When they measured your ring size, you 
indicated that finger, didn't you?

16:06.010 --> 16:08.940
I suppose you say it's a 
notion I've always had.

16:09.600 --> 16:13.760
<i>Putting a ring on the third finger 
of the left hand during the wedding</i>

16:13.760 --> 16:16.450
<i>is the custom in the country I was born in.</i>

16:16.880 --> 16:19.780
But, Your Highness, why did you 
decide to give me a ring at all?

16:19.780 --> 16:23.100
No particular reason. And the fact that 
it's a ring holds no specific meaning.

16:24.160 --> 16:28.080
But you often work with 
your hands, don't you?

16:29.900 --> 16:34.040
To have an ornament I gave 
you on those fingers...

16:34.040 --> 16:36.970
I was certain that it 
would make me feel good.

16:37.760 --> 16:39.040
That's...

16:49.040 --> 16:51.900
Then, the morning that it's finished...

16:51.900 --> 16:53.990
I'll show you before anyone else.

16:54.260 --> 16:54.970
Good.

17:10.040 --> 17:11.580
<i>Could it be?</i>

17:12.960 --> 17:17.200
Come to think of it, I heard 
that Count Lawvine had arrived.

17:17.200 --> 17:19.440
Whose guest is he?

17:19.440 --> 17:20.910
I called him here.

17:20.910 --> 17:24.050
He's the best qualified person to 
instruct the knight candidates.

17:27.070 --> 17:28.020
Your Highness...

17:28.020 --> 17:31.270
who are you waiting for in this place?

17:31.270 --> 17:33.820
That's quite an abrupt question.

17:34.280 --> 17:39.260
Count Lawvine protects a 
very important location.

17:39.260 --> 17:43.820
I can't imagine that you'd call him 
here simply to train the recruits.

17:45.110 --> 17:48.340
And what made you think that 
I'm waiting for someone?

17:48.340 --> 17:52.310
Your Highness frequently 
checked your pocket watch.

17:52.800 --> 17:56.300
I thought that you were concerned about 
what time to return to the palace,

17:56.300 --> 18:00.180
but since we arrived here, you 
haven't once taken out your watch.

18:00.590 --> 18:05.730
Additionally, this is a spot where one 
can observe people entering the capital.

18:08.620 --> 18:12.490
The other day, a letter 
arrived from another country.

18:13.440 --> 18:15.750
It said that the sender wouldn't 
be able to attend the wedding,

18:15.750 --> 18:17.820
so they would come to celebrate in advance.

18:18.910 --> 18:23.330
Before I could send a reply to say that 
wouldn't be necessary, another letter arrived.

18:23.330 --> 18:25.830
It said that they wanted to 
celebrate as soon as possible,

18:25.830 --> 18:28.290
so they'd leave without awaiting a reply.

18:29.240 --> 18:33.910
At the marketplace, someone was selling 
fruit that had just arrived from Coyolles.

18:33.910 --> 18:36.490
The sender of the letter 
was on that same ship?

18:36.970 --> 18:40.840
Given the information from my scouts and 
the time it takes a carriage to travel...

19:00.680 --> 19:01.910
Weitzner,

19:02.440 --> 19:04.410
I want to protect this kingdom.

19:09.890 --> 19:11.340
<i>Prince Kyle...</i>

19:15.070 --> 19:18.390
Earlier, Kyle had an audience 
with His Majesty, my father,

19:18.390 --> 19:20.010
and he was given permission to stay.

19:20.640 --> 19:24.280
As I thought, he must have a 
particular aim in coming here.

19:27.440 --> 19:31.810
The Prince of Coyolles, His Highness Kyle 
Morgan Cleverly, is here to see you.

19:33.560 --> 19:38.330
I congratulate you on the occasion 
of your marriage, Prince Arnold.

19:38.330 --> 19:43.460
I, Kyle Morgan Cleverly, representing 
my father, King of Coyolles,

19:43.460 --> 19:45.840
hastened here to in hopes 
of celebrating the event.

19:45.840 --> 19:48.490
You have taken many pains 
to travel all this way.

19:48.490 --> 19:50.660
For that I offer my heartfelt gratitude.

19:51.560 --> 19:55.640
<i>There is a great difference in strength 
between this empire and Coyolles.</i>

19:56.500 --> 19:59.680
<i>Coyolles is a country which 
produces gems, gold, and silver.</i>

19:59.680 --> 20:01.550
<i>They're wealthy, but...</i>

20:02.170 --> 20:04.980
<i>for most of the year, they're 
virtually cut off by snow.</i>

20:04.980 --> 20:07.150
<i>For food and other necessities of daily life</i>

20:07.150 --> 20:10.360
<i>they must depend upon trade with 
their neighboring countries.</i>

20:10.360 --> 20:11.780
<i>And five years from now,</i>

20:11.780 --> 20:15.140
<i>they are destroyed in the war 
that Prince Arnold instigates.</i>

20:16.900 --> 20:17.810
Rishe.

20:17.810 --> 20:19.900
Yes, Prince Arnold?

20:22.510 --> 20:24.430
This is Rishe, who will be my wife.

20:24.430 --> 20:26.350
I'm honored to meet you.

20:26.350 --> 20:29.160
My name is Rishe Irmgard Weitzner.

20:29.160 --> 20:31.760
I am extraordinarily delighted to meet you.

20:32.290 --> 20:38.860
I knew that anyone who would become Prince 
Arnold's wife must surely be a magnificent lady...

20:43.200 --> 20:47.060
but I never imagined anyone 
of such a caliber as yourself.

20:47.660 --> 20:50.180
You are a warm, beautiful goddess.

20:51.180 --> 20:54.390
I am undeserving of such words, Prince Kyle.

20:54.390 --> 20:56.650
<i>More important than these 
empty social pleasantries...</i>

20:54.390 --> 20:56.650
Even the gold which my 
kingdom is so proud of,

20:56.930 --> 20:59.600
<i>Prince Kyle has far too 
little color in his face!</i>

20:56.930 --> 20:59.600
is no match for the brilliance 
emanating from you, Lady Rishe.

20:59.600 --> 21:01.950
Even flowers at the height of their 
beauty, blooming in profusion,

20:59.600 --> 21:03.530
<i>His skin is already pale to begin 
with, but he looks nearly blue now!</i>

21:01.950 --> 21:03.530
would feel shamed in your presence.

21:13.800 --> 21:15.920
Did you learn something?

21:15.920 --> 21:17.440
I can't quite grasp it.

21:17.440 --> 21:19.060
Everything he said was innocuous.

21:19.060 --> 21:20.920
He didn't show even a sliver 
of his true intentions.

21:20.920 --> 21:21.600
What?

21:21.600 --> 21:25.300
Then, earlier, the look you had, like you 
were about to kill with your gaze...

21:25.300 --> 21:26.570
What was that?

21:27.300 --> 21:32.280
More importantly, Kyle seems to have brought
 a number of academics from Coyolles.

21:32.280 --> 21:33.060
What?

21:34.210 --> 21:37.040
Your color has improved tremendously, Kyle.

21:39.500 --> 21:40.950
<i>It couldn't be.</i>

21:42.110 --> 21:45.130
If you want to hear what they have 
to say, too, I'll make arrangements.

21:45.850 --> 21:47.390
I would be happy to!

21:47.390 --> 21:50.950
Actually, I've heard that 
Prince Kyle is very weak,

21:50.950 --> 21:53.660
and I have a medicine 
I'd like for him to try!

21:53.660 --> 21:56.300
If the scholars he has 
with him will permit it,

21:56.300 --> 21:59.080
then there won't be any need 
to slip the drug into his food!

22:01.210 --> 22:02.750
That was a joke.

22:02.750 --> 22:05.630
It didn't sound like a joke.

22:05.630 --> 22:09.560
First, tomorrow there will be a welcome 
feast for him, though it will be a bother.

22:09.560 --> 22:12.260
Of course. I will have the preparations made.

22:12.260 --> 22:15.270
I'll have Kyle and Lawvine 
meet face-to-face there.

22:15.880 --> 22:18.240
Whatever Kyle might be plotting,

22:18.240 --> 22:19.690
that should serve to keep him in check.

22:20.970 --> 22:22.920
Hey, why are you making that expression?

22:22.920 --> 22:24.530
Oh, it's nothing!

22:25.120 --> 22:29.780
<i>If Count Lawvine comes to the 
party tomorrow evening...</i>

22:30.960 --> 22:33.610
<i>the fact that I'm Lucius will be revealed!</i>
